  hazardName: Disposal of hazardous waste in electronic waste bins (explosion risk)
  description: Hazardous waste such as batteries, aerosol containers, and flammable
    materials must not be disposed of in electronic waste bins, as this may lead
    to explosion and fire risks. Waste must be separated according to its type and
    disposed of in the appropriate designated containers.
